      "controller_support": "full",
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480830/extras/38f081da675d5be2e60ecd9d9fcea6da.poster.avif?t=1740566202\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480830/extras/38f081da675d5be2e60ecd9d9fcea6da.webm?t=1740566202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480830/extras/38f081da675d5be2e60ecd9d9fcea6da.mp4?t=1740566202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silvia</strong> never runs from evil—she makes it her business. Eccentric yet warm-hearted, this seasoned modern exorcist has mastered the art of confronting the supernatural, turning haunted places into tangible nightmares. But on this fateful night, nothing goes as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a relentless <strong>survival action</strong> experience where the unexpected awaits at every turn. Roam the eerie halls of an abandoned performing arts school—each room revealing a new piece of its dark past. Scavenge for scarce resources, crack intricate puzzles, and engage in heart-pounding combat against grotesque creatures and unforgettable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evil Tonight</i> combines classic survival-horror cues with fast-paced action, keeping you on edge but never forgetting the fun. Lose yourself in meticulously crafted pixel art, vibrant custom color palettes, and hand-tuned lighting effects—all set to a spine-tingling original score that elevates every moment of tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dare to face... <strong><i>Evil Tonight</i></strong>?</p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480830/extras/38f081da675d5be2e60ecd9d9fcea6da.poster.avif?t=1740566202\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480830/extras/38f081da675d5be2e60ecd9d9fcea6da.webm?t=1740566202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480830/extras/38f081da675d5be2e60ecd9d9fcea6da.mp4?t=1740566202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silvia</strong> never runs from evil—she makes it her business. Eccentric yet warm-hearted, this seasoned modern exorcist has mastered the art of confronting the supernatural, turning haunted places into tangible nightmares. But on this fateful night, nothing goes as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a relentless <strong>survival action</strong> experience where the unexpected awaits at every turn. Roam the eerie halls of an abandoned performing arts school—each room revealing a new piece of its dark past. Scavenge for scarce resources, crack intricate puzzles, and engage in heart-pounding combat against grotesque creatures and unforgettable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evil Tonight</i> combines classic survival-horror cues with fast-paced action, keeping you on edge but never forgetting the fun. Lose yourself in meticulously crafted pixel art, vibrant custom color palettes, and hand-tuned lighting effects—all set to a spine-tingling original score that elevates every moment of tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dare to face... <strong><i>Evil Tonight</i></strong>?</p>",
